# A discarded land exiled by Rest in Peace still pays the cost and makes Land's Edge deal damage.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Land's Edge
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Rest in Peace
Mountain
Plains
Plains x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Land's Edge.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rest in Peace.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Land's Edge.Activate(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Exile = Black Lotus; Mountain
